This product includes embedded and relocated source code from the following
third-party projects. The original package names have been relocated as noted
below.

- ClassGraph
  - Version: 4.8.184 (the forked source is under core/src/main/java/nonapi/org/paramixel/classgraph)
  - Website: https://github.com/classgraph/classgraph
  - License: MIT License
  - Original packages: io.github.classgraph, nonapi.io.github.classgraph
  - Relocated to: nonapi.org.paramixel.classgraph.io.github.classgraph,
    nonapi.org.paramixel.classgraph.nonapi.io.github.classgraph
  - Copyright:
    - Copyright (c) 2019-2021 Luke Hutchison
    - Copyright (c) 2016 Johno Crawford
    - Copyright (c) 2017 Harith Elrufaie
  - Local modifications (fork maintenance notes):
    - The source is vendored and relocated so Paramixel has no runtime
      dependency and no unrelocated third-party packages.
    - Files are excluded from JaCoCo coverage and from published Javadoc (see
      core/pom.xml); keep the vendored sources in their upstream layout and
      do not reformat them.
    - To update: replace the two relocated trees with the sources of the new
      upstream release, keep the relocation, and re-run the core test suite,
      which exercises discovery, annotation scanning and class loading.
    - Paramixel uses only the scanning API (ClassGraph, ScanResult, ClassInfo,
      MethodInfo, AnnotationInfo); reflection JSON support is unused.

